# Features

Purpose:
  Feature planning, decision, and layer assignment system.
  Analyzes project state, evaluates new features, and assigns
  work to appropriate layers (L0, L1, L2, ...).

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1 @INDEX.sdd
   2 @layers.sdd
   3 @decisions.sdd
   4 @../projects/example_project/MAP.md

Rules:
  [FTR1] Features MUST be assigned to a layer (L0, L1, L2, ...).
  [FTR2] Layer assignment is based on project maturity and complexity.
  [FTR3] L0 = MVP/core features (already implemented).
  [FTR4] L1 = Customer-requested features (next priority).
  [FTR5] L2+ = Future enhancements and optimizations.
  [FTR6] Feature decisions MUST be documented in decisions/.
  [FTR7] Project-specific features live in projects/example_project/.

Navigation:
  Layers: @layers.sdd
  Decisions: @decisions.sdd
  ProjectMap: @../projects/example_project/MAP.md
  ProjectStructure: @../projects/example_project/STRUCTURE.md
  Registry: @../projects/INDEX.sdd

State: +
